### Reference data for the report form (public)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/departments

### Register a Citizen and keep the token
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Patil",
  "email": "asha.{{$random.alphanumeric(6)}}@example.test",
  "password": "citizen-pass-123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Report an issue (Citizen only); department, priority and deadline are set by the server
POST {{host}}/api/v1/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Deep pothole on FC Road",
  "description": "Large pothole near the bus stop; two-wheelers are slipping.",
  "category": "POTHOLE",
  "latitude": 18.5236,
  "longitude": 73.8478,
  "address": "FC Road, Shivaji Nagar, Pune"
}

> {% client.global.set("issueId", response.body.id); %}

### Issue detail (public; the reporter also sees their contact block)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues/{{issueId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My reports
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search: filters can be combined; all optional
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues?status=REPORTED&priority=HIGH&priority=CRITICAL&q=water&page=0&size=20

### Search by category, department and date range
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues?category=GARBAGE&from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T00:00:00Z

### Map markers for a viewport (minLng,minLat,maxLng,maxLat) — Pune
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues/map?bbox=73.70,18.40,74.00,18.65
